<p class="md-p">最小值随栈的每一层一起保存；弹出一层就恢复上一层的最小值，重复最小值也不会丢失。</p><p class="md-p">考点：辅助栈。</p>
<p class="md-p">解法：</p>
<div class="md-list-wrap"><ul class="md-list md-depth-0"><li>一个栈存所有元素。</li><li>一个栈存当前最小值。</li><li>push 时同步压入最小值，pop 时同步弹出。</li></ul></div>
<p class="md-p">输入格式：多行操作指令，第一行为操作次数 n，接下来 n 行为操作（push x / pop / top / getMin）。 输出格式：对 top 和 getMin 操作输出对应结果。</p>
<section class="code-card md-code-card"><div class="code-toolbar"><div class="toolbar-left"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="file-label">数据结构总结.java</span></div><button class="copy-button md-copy" type="button">复制代码</button></div><div class="code-scroll"><pre class="md-pre" data-lang="java">import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        int n = Integer.parseInt(sc.nextLine().trim());
        Deque&lt;Integer&gt; stack = new ArrayDeque&lt;&gt;();
        Deque&lt;Integer&gt; minStack = new ArrayDeque&lt;&gt;();
        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();
        for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {
            String line = sc.nextLine().trim();
            if (line.startsWith(&quot;push&quot;)) {
                int x = Integer.parseInt(line.split(&quot; &quot;)[1]);
                stack.push(x);
                // 最小栈压入当前最小值
                if (minStack.isEmpty()) {
                    minStack.push(x);
                } else {
                    minStack.push(Math.min(x, minStack.peek()));
                }
            } else if (line.equals(&quot;pop&quot;)) {
                stack.pop();
                minStack.pop();
            } else if (line.equals(&quot;top&quot;)) {
                sb.append(stack.peek()).append(&quot;\n&quot;);
            } else if (line.equals(&quot;getMin&quot;)) {
                sb.append(minStack.peek()).append(&quot;\n&quot;);
            }
        }
        System.out.print(sb);
    }
}</pre></div></section>